    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "French Immersion has its own registration. Crescent Park, Jessie Lee, Laronde and Peace Arch Elementary feed French Immersion into Earl Marriott Secondary. The Ministry file also marks Pacific Heights Elementary as offering French Immersion, so ask the district how that program is fed. White Rock is not one catchment: White Rock Elementary feeds Semiahmoo Secondary and Peace Arch Elementary feeds Earl Marriott."
    },
